{
  "_comment": [
    "Contributor variant: runs the servers from YOUR WORKING TREE instead of",
    "the published packages. Copy over .mcp.json when you want a client to",
    "exercise local changes:  cp .mcp.json.example .mcp.json",
    "",
    "Requires a build first — dist/ is gitignored, so these paths do not",
    "exist in a fresh clone:  npm ci && npm run build",
    "",
    "The paths are relative, so the client's working directory must be the",
    "repo root. Clients read MCP config at startup: restart yours after the",
    "first build, or it will have already given up on a command that failed.",
    "",
    "Do not commit the result — the checked-in .mcp.json deliberately uses",
    "npx so that opening this repo in any MCP client works with no build."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "finops-framework": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["dist/servers/framework/main.js"]
    },
    "focus-spec": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["dist/servers/focus/main.js"]
    }
  }
}
